Privacy Policy for Carlink Dashboard
Last updated: 16.02.2026
Carlink Dashboard is a companion app designed to manage local USB devices. We prioritize user privacy and data security.

1. No Data Collection
We do not collect, store, or transmit any personal information, usage statistics, or user data. All operations are performed locally on your device.

2. No Network Access
The Application does not require or use an internet connection. No data is ever sent to external servers or third parties.

3. Permissions and USB Access
USB Permission: The app requires access to the USB port solely to communicate with the connected hardware device.
Local Storage: The app may use local storage only to save your device configurations or preferences. This data remains on your device and is not shared.

4. Third-Party Services
The Application does not use any third-party SDKs, analytics, or advertising networks.

5. Contact Us
If you have any questions, please contact us at: mail@jadjer.by.
